This repository (`decon-web`) is strictly a local, non-commercial educational
and architectural deconstruction archive created to study modern creative web
engineering, WebGL/GLSL shaders, procedural audio, and high-craft UI systems.

All third-party brand identities, visual designs, artwork, photographs, audio
mixes, and 3D assets mirrored or referenced within `sites/` remain the exclusive
intellectual property of their respective creators and copyright holders:

